{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_005_03_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7d9aabc45b06754084efdfce09f2e175714e72a7fb74922a162bbc24aee0b64f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_c:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffa897c9864af0b2d70e6a2b0b0c7dbfba3e60c86c9802bdf7a6d03d9b9fabd0",
      "text": "在此之后苍井享介选手也没能找回状态，\n接连出现失误，最终被替换下场。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cf3985eb1759688095725dd477d5557af2c1a2cd47871609b652e433cf3b412",
      "text": "享介状态不好的原因……是我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abe3bf4d262881738d73c7aaf3d771b987da3846683f4bac83e2d92ccdd4a907",
      "text": "康复训练进行得很顺利。\n只不过，即便伤势彻底痊愈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35d268e8669705034ba33a9d2967d871fd60e5ef84129aec3a90ed1972103531",
      "text": "暂时也不建议进行剧烈运动。像以前那样\n作为足球运动员满场飞奔，近期最好还是避免……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45d3041c9778460ca47ec4fee4170650fb378e30789f0e6ec3c98386ed6199bc",
      "text": "“暂时”大概是多久？\n现在对我们来说是非常重要的时期！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:feb171242aaaca0520832405f9da2733699b2f120b9e6ffb939da222ec5a27d7",
      "text": "……享介这家伙，前阵子一起去听诊断结果的时候，\n问医生的问题比我还多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:639b6902fa3a40ef8a0aeb49fce38c8b8edd713f7165f971824d4cbd274289dc",
      "text": "（不管我怎么说“我没事所以别担心”，\n也根本起不到任何作用）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_c:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:932ef9e3129ec737d8c36af718d1d487730035221009d1e3d2e4bb58017f4006",
      "text": "……好的，比分依然在变动！\n机会来了！能否实现逆转呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_c:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2980daadad8a4e4167c9a900ff514cd207060d8a5df7e08a0d6ceef424181b18",
      "text": "（享介……以你的实力，\n就算一个人也完全可以大放异彩的啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
